    "When you say \"a total of 50 new workers must be trained by the end of the 8th week,\" do you mean that 50 trainees must have completed their 2-week training (and thus become productive) by the end of week 8, or that 50 trainees must have started training by the end of week 8 (some of whom would still be in training at week 8's end)?"
